    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2260" root="برز" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَارِزٌ</span></b>  act. part. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَرَزَ</span> [q. v.]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>Wholly,</i> or
<i>entirely, apparent</i> or <i>manifest.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَارِزَةٌ</span> <i>Land that is apparent, open,</i> or <i>uncovered,</i>
(Bd and Jel in xviii. 45, and TA,) <i>upon which
is no mountain nor any other thing,</i> (Jel,) or
<i>that has no hill nor mountain nor sand.</i> (TA.)

